use source-file ownership does not authorize an unrelated knowledge-base write. The assessment is limited to the declared entry and fixed crop; source discovery is not-tested.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"POST /process/file is implemented by process_file and receives the verified user through get_verified_user.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":27,"endLine":32}]},{"id":"f-principal-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"For a non-admin caller, file retrieval is constrained by the caller's user ID, which binds the source-file access to that user.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":40,"endLine":45}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"A supplied form collection_name becomes the selected collection_name; only when it is absent is a file-derived default selected.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":21,"endLine":25},{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":47,"endLine":50}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"The visible non-admin authorization control concerns retrieval of the source file by user ID; the supplied crop reports no call authorizing collection_name in the omitted processing and update section.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":40,"endLine":45},{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":52,"endLine":53}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The destination write sink inserts the constructed items into VECTOR_DB_CLIENT with collection_name.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":14,"endLine":18}]},{"id":"f-effect-path","kind":"effect","statement":"process_file passes the selected collection_name and the file-derived metadata to save_docs_to_vector_db, with add enabled when the caller supplied collection_name.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":62,"endLine":74}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The requested condition is satisfied by the task premise that the caller supplies an existing caller-selected collection name and is a verified non-admin; the source shows the supplied name is retained for the save call.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":27,"endLine":32},{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":47,"endLine":50},{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":62,"endLine":74}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":3081,"output":1063,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":22252.3344,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T12:55:01.410Z"}}
